{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4Kc0Vu9nPFNOvORCas8ZPQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:12.265411+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4Kc0Vu9nPFNOvORCas8ZPQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>对外经济贸易大学中国金融学院，传承金融办学深厚积淀，拥有完整的</span><strong><span>学士-硕士-博士-博士后</span></strong><span>全链条人才培养体系。学院师资力量雄厚，学科特色鲜明，深耕涉外金融人才培养，坚持理论研究与行业实践并重，毕业生广泛就业于金融监管部门、银行、券商、基金、央国企等各类机构，就业质量保持高位稳定。</span></p><p><strong><span>2027</span></strong><span>年，我院面向全国优秀应届本科毕业生接收推荐免试攻读硕士、直博研究生，热忱欢迎有志投身金融学术研究与金融实务领域的优秀学子加入中国金融学院。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业及拟招收计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>注：以下均为拟招生计划，实际录取人数以教育部正式下达招生指标、生源情况为准。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业学位硕士｜金融（025100）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>拟招收</span><strong><span>149 人</span></strong><span>，其中包含</span><strong><span>“国家卓越社科人才培养基地” 专项计划 11 人</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>下设银行管理、资本市场、金融工程、量化投资四个培养方向；其中量化投资方向侧重数理、编程与二级市场投资能力培养，欢迎计算机、数学、统计、物理等背景同学报考。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学术学位硕士</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>1.金融工程：</span></strong><span>拟招收 </span><strong><span>7 人</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2.金融学（硕博连读贯通培养）：</span></strong><span>拟招收</span><strong><span> 5 人</span></strong></p><p><span>面向有志长期从事金融学术研究的同学，贯通式学术培养，夯实科研能力。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>博士项目｜本科直博生</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>招生专业：</span><strong><span>金融学、金融工程</span></strong><span>招生人数：根据生源情况择优确定。</span></p><p><span>直博生学制 5 年，实行导师负责制，聚焦高水平学术科研训练。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>国家卓越社科人才培养基地专项计划</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>我院将在金融专业学位推免生中择优遴选本基地候选人，项目深度对接国家金融对外开放、跨境金融治理等国家战略人才需求。</span></p><p><span><span>项目以</span></span><strong><span><span>“国际经贸 + X”</span></span></strong><span><span>多学科交叉融合为支撑，秉持</span></span><strong><span><span>家国情怀、中国根基、全球视野、实战能力</span></span></strong><span><span>四位一体育人理念，构建</span></span><strong><span><span>定制化培养方案、顶尖师资配置、公派海外研修、高水平实习实践</span></span></strong><span><span>全链条支持体系。</span></span></p><p><span>项目核心支持：</span></p><p><span>1. 优先推荐申请国家留学基金委公派资助项目；</span></p><p><span>2. 优先推送涉外岗位、国际组织、海外金融机构实习实践机会；</span></p><p><span>3. </span><strong><span>可享受学校统一校内住宿；</span></strong></p><p><span>申请方式、申请条件、选拔方式等更多信息请关注我校研究生院官方后续发布的通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式与重要时间提醒</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报考我院推免生，需要完成</span><strong><span>双系统报名</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><strong><span> 对外经济贸易大学推免生招生系统</span></strong><span>报名</span></p><p><span><span>系统截止时间：</span></span><strong><span><span>2026 年 9 月 6 日中午 12:00</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2. 待国家平台开通后，完成</span><strong><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（全国推免服务系统）</span></strong><span>填报确认。</span></p><p><span>有关申请具体信息、复试资格认定、复试考核安排、拟录取公示等全部流程细则，请密切关注</span><strong><span>对外经济贸易大学研究生院官网</span></strong><span>已发布和后续发布通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>往期研究生就业信息</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院研究生就业率长期稳定保持高位，硕士毕业生主要流向国家金融监管机构、国有大行总行及重点分支机构、头部券商、公募基金、资管机构、央企财务部门、政府事业单位；博士毕业生多进入高校、国家级金融智库、核心金融机构研究部门任职，同时不少复合型背景学子投身金融科技赛道，去往头部科技企业。同学们既可以奔赴市场化金融平台，也可以投身国家战略领域，服务金融强国建设。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>学院近几年的就业情况可以参见链接：</span></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MDkzNDAwNQ==&amp;mid=2649595079&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c996539b15d80b6d6270cc5ddd314c6b&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中国金融学院2025届研究生就业率、就业质量继续保持高水平</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MDkzNDAwNQ==&amp;mid=2649590989&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b156ead8c6167f3b287c9032dd8e1d8c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中国金融学院2024届研究生就业率、就业质量继续保持高水平</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MDkzNDAwNQ==&amp;mid=2649584952&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7e27ff76344d83bd7e68af5ce31426bd&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">金融学院2022届研究生就业率、就业质量继续保持高水平</a></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ccicSyz9ElgSXFbRWicibWTuCqqlLCMzBktYUsbLrxfah6rlngjOHSSvC96bsU6wmw9JkDFY7VYL9vCWVcbTibSWHDxsG5H9EAKv6pcEmkyNrWI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><b><span>学院寄语</span></b></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ccicSyz9ElgQ7wBuxVkV5utiaWcBu7dXWZQCeSfrMQlYrsLo6EgWTxEmpmBcib49AM8er6urK708lmPXXJaEKtrXwZaUeGonqOlibCA11O9vPAw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>金融强国建设呼唤新一代复合型金融人才。中国金融学院将为你提供优质师资、完备科研平台、多元实践与国际化交流机会。期待心怀理想的你，在惠园求索真知，与我们共同投身新时代金融事业。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>咨询渠道</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section